Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Phyrexian Walker
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Phyrexian Walker
Ornithopter
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Phyrexian Walker.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Part Water.Cast(X: 2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
! Bot1.Target(Count: 1)
! Bot1.Target(Count: 3)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker; Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Keywords = Islandwalk
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying; Islandwalk
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Attack(Phyrexian Walker > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Phyrexian Walker > Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Phyrexian Walker.Keywords = (absent)
[Expect]
